# lkwd-nuxt-tmpl Cursor rules

Follow [`.agent/AGENTS.md`](../../.agent/AGENTS.md) as the canonical shared policy. Root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) is only a stub that points there.

- Nuxt 4, TypeScript strict, Pug templates, SCSS styles
- Node 26+; npm; house `SYS_ENV` (`local` | `image` | `server`)
- Vitest + Playwright always-on; optional overlays stay off unless requested
- Exhaustive switches on unions; no inline imports
- Edit `.agent/AGENTS.md` first when changing policy; keep `.codex/` aligned
